[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Economy/ShopStockEntry.cs" id="2_entry"]

; Ash Dunmore, collier (Phase 38L). The `fuel` tag in one stall: charcoal for the forges and pitch for
; everything else. Both unlimited - a smith who cannot get charcoal is a crafting system with a shopping
; trip bolted to it, which is the argument Bryn's ingots already won.
;
; His pot of pitch wears `fuel` and `reagent`, the same trick Hana's fish oil plays: no specialist on this
; square is sealed off from every other one.
;
; He buys ore he does not sell (`ore` is accepted, `fuel` is the specialty) because a collier burns through
; the same seams the miners work. 38N's Emberdeep Mine is who he is really waiting for.

